[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "giuoco-main 1...e5"]
[Name "The Vienna: 2.Nc3 Nc6 3.Nf3"]

2. Nc3 { The Vienna Game. White guards e4 and keeps the f-pawn free to move. [%cal Gf2f4] }
2... Nc6 { The same knight move as always. It means that most of the openings here come out the same. }
3. Nf3 { The most common move, and after 3...Nf6 this is the Four Knights by another order. } *
